[{"title":"游宝掌山寺","author":"方凤","text":"兹辰欲有适，轩车偶来骎。\n斸苔北村南，荒竹晴窗阴。\n接语未及久，相邀指丛林。\n涧行任诘曲，岩眺经嵚崟。\n于时春早暄，生意见草心。\n红紫寂未动，万山苍翠深。\n伊予夙好游，忽忽老见侵。\n孤兴尚衡霍，遐思或巫黔。\n况此近居里，而能盍朋簪。\n裂石发悲啸，沿流引清斟。\n扪萝复忘疲，古洞穷幽寻。\n岂无声利痼，见笑山水淫。\n人生本来浮，世故未易任。\n藓崖拂前题，俛仰已昔今。\n我法姑用我，眷言属同襟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1016,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"答柳道传饷笋","author":"方凤","text":"东家鼎烹矜大嚼，西家呼卢赛乳酪。\n肉食那知儒素风，似君臭味将无同。\n知我山斋少白粲，随时易办松花饭。\n佐食投箸毋乃馋，筠笼新掘来幽岩。\n封题遥寄四五尾，歆然解剥出肌理。\n和以芹根及薤芽，醯盐澹著香无涯。\n黄齑脱粟绝滓腻，得此加餐检残笥。\n手把南华读一过，诗思陡涌如春波。\n题箑酬君君莫笑，胸中成竹谐清调。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1017,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题光风霁月楼","author":"方凤","text":"人间底处无风月，知用何时最佳绝。\n芳播崇楼淑气浮，影涵古桂清辉发。\n向来雅重无极翁，洒落襟怀与此同。\n去之百世犹彷佛，宛见道貌匡庐中。\n谁题品语黄太史，大书四字紫阳子。\n今从建水得此本，如拾蠙珠捲文绮。\n携归八咏双溪州，晏然直与造化游。\n无边妙处乃萃此，韪矣君家百尺楼。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1018,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题郑氏义门","author":"方凤","text":"人爱渭水清，毕竟河流浑。\n不知黄虞世，何处觅旌门。\n旌门纵百世，岂能外彝伦。\n祇因风气漓，遂表为义民。\n麟溪有寒泉，西流类拖绅。\n泉声遍塞耳，乱却牝鸡晨。\n夜帐泼烟黑，秋缸吐火红。\n六世孝友家，元属书声中。\n烂银铺作榜，绰楔何崔崔。\n户神似相语，莫遣阿奴来。\n人心一遭蛊，五官皆作魔。\n不赓斯干诗，却听燃萁歌。\n兄弟本一气，为利分汝尔。\n借问嗜利人，千载得不死。\n鸱鸮巢满林，何地不感恻。\n若非慈乌啼，血泪收不得。\n我身亲乃有，况此身外物。\n世人果何思，肝胆每相贼。\n当年朱两轓，回首血在颐。\n争如义门鬼，千载不馁而。\n何人非杨椿，如椿能几人。\n祇缘本心死，所以有缁磷。\n大树大十围，枝叶日敷蕃。\n愿培百尺土，庇此千岁根。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1019,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"题春寿堂","author":"方凤","text":"人皆构堂思奉身，吴氏构堂独养亲。\n人皆种花图炫眸，吴氏树萱可忘忧。\n慈亲鹤发寿且康，昆弟列罗如雁行。\n旦暮升堂直滫瀡，娱亲嬉舞斑衣裳。\n子能顺亲亲颜悦，和气盈盈蔼堂室。\n春风荆树发条枝，夜雨芝兰秀芽茁。\n由来孝道通神明，吴氏家世应昌荣。\n他年移孝事君主，定使芳名书信史。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1020,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"赠张叔元镇帅","author":"方凤","text":"越东佳气郁巃嵷，捉鼻馨名久识公。\n结发蚤看翔艺苑，濡毫频见属诗筒。\n弃书忽学万人敌，秉钺尤誇一世雄。\n拔距三千堪敌忾，歌钟二八陋和戎。\n长驱誓捣燕幽北，大纛旋移浦汭东。\n重巩河山襄帝力，时垂竹帛励臣忠。\n东南半壁腾王气，杞梓全材恃将功。\n鹅鸭几惊消玉垒，熊罴屡奋壮金墉。\n玺书褒锡恩原厚，节钺招绥德愈隆。\n群策更能延俊彦，众讴先已遍旄童。\n深仁共颂绵瓜瓞，伟绩还期勒华嵩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1021,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"丁桥晓行","author":"方回","text":"苕水无声镜面光，渔家孤艇泊中央。\n十幅生绡谁画得，一轮斜月一篷霜。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1022,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其二","author":"方回","text":"顿尔缪为象山学，雕吾痛绝水心文。\n潜夫诗格温夫字，掩耳平生不愿闻。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1023,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其七","author":"方回","text":"脍炙鲸鹏吾不佞，撮扪蚤虱尔徒劳。\n泰山夜半见红日，政要人生著脚高。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1024,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其八","author":"方回","text":"后山卒仅四十九，讳日崇宁一日前。\n当时假使馀七帙，忍见中原丙午年。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1025,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其四","author":"方回","text":"郑玄三礼王弼易，亦绘冕旒配孔庭。\n虚耗中原实卫霍，麒麟阁上也图形。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1026,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其一","author":"方回","text":"自知酒量防踰矩，敢诧诗才妙斲轮。\n古圣贤心得丝许，虽非尼扁异愚民。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1027,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其十","author":"方回","text":"少陵诗诧古来希，老病馀生曷不归。\n不信神仙不信佛，死时惟裹破深衣。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1028,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其九","author":"方回","text":"周家八百年天下，文武焉知有赧王。\n老寿彭公亦馀骨，始知生死是兴亡。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1029,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"七十翁吟七言十绝 其六","author":"方回","text":"恨予生不及晦翁，撰杖鹅湖观异同。\n岂减游杨侍程子，未甘籍湜事韩公。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1030,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"二月十五日赵君实南山别墅俟主客俱不至","author":"方回","text":"篱落梅残野菜青，田间閒看鹤梳翎。\n主人不到客且去，细雨南山暗画屏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1031,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"二月朔大雪已五日三首 其三","author":"方回","text":"牛马毛寒缩如猬，古今此句绝奇奇。\n今春大雪亦将尔，莺死无声社燕迟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1032,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"二月朔大雪已五日三首 其二","author":"方回","text":"燕山雪花大如席，岂料江南亦见之。\n腊前六出知焉往，却在春风二月时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1033,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"二月朔大雪已五日三首 其一","author":"方回","text":"侵寻半月是花朝，大雪漫天五日飘。\n腊月如春众芳吐，繁华时节却萧条。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1034,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"八月十二日过湖","author":"方回","text":"荷已无花柳欲陈，秋风飒飒水粼粼。\n湖山惨淡西施老，细看终于胜丑人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1035,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"十七日大雪","author":"方回","text":"扁舟未觉出城难，访旧情知老畏寒。\n七十五翁无□□，□楼聊且隔帘看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1036,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"十六日大雪","author":"方回","text":"长至前踰一月晴，忽然细细雨无声。\n中宵变作今□□，□得楼头鼓角清。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1037,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"十四日至节","author":"方回","text":"钱塘多少富豪家，酒肉如山赏物华。\n野老入城□□□，□萝卜菜腊梅花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1038,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"又题画赤脚仙","author":"方回","text":"万古天冠地屦身，画师游戏恐非真。\n父生师教成何事，甘作蓬头跣足人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1039,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺还五首 其五","author":"方回","text":"七十二翁头雪白，弱冠初游鬓如漆。\n除却一二老山僧，独来独往无人识。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1040,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺还五首 其四","author":"方回","text":"山中事事胜人间，莫怪山翁喜入山。\n才说出山心不喜，又将身世堕尘寰。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1041,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺还五首 其三","author":"方回","text":"涧晴石出水穿沙，万树松杉隐数家。\n一鸟不鸣风不动，忽闻林下响缫车。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1042,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺还五首 其二","author":"方回","text":"松枝垂地荫松身，恨不移家此卜邻。\n石上一根长数丈，似吾细看更无人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1043,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺还五首 其一","author":"方回","text":"城中决定少新诗，便向湖光也未宜。\n我有新诗无数处，三天竺路笋舆迟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1044,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三天竺道中","author":"方回","text":"三天竺路渐平登，高似雷峰塔几层。\n山到无人行处好，松阴万树立孤僧。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1045,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三月三日西湖第三桥四首 其四","author":"方回","text":"野蔌随宜酒半醺，富儿盘馔拥红裙。\n兰亭会上无丝竹，芥蒂区区笑右军。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1046,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三月三日西湖第三桥四首 其三","author":"方回","text":"尽道西湖久寂寥，红栏干落但空桥。\n细思未有苏堤日，且把閒愁著酒浇。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1047,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三月三日西湖第三桥四首 其二","author":"方回","text":"正月桥西卖酒家，柳初青眼草初芽。\n重来红紫随风雨，犹有野田黄菜花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1048,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三月三日西湖第三桥四首 其一","author":"方回","text":"北曲南歌日日新，红妆不逐落红春。\n网鱼野老何曾觑，岂是心肠木石人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1049,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三竺道中三首 其三","author":"方回","text":"石溪清浅不容舟，但有常常绿水流。\n莫道江湖风浪阔，此中涓滴是源头。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1050,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三竺道中三首 其二","author":"方回","text":"少人行处路方佳，半著僧鞋半草鞋。\n直到全无马粪处，山僮竹帚扫松钗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1051,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三竺道中三首 其一","author":"方回","text":"武林风物异他乡，三竺山行草亦香。\n村落寻常绩麻处，隔帘时复见红妆。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1052,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三贤堂已无官卖其址","author":"方回","text":"三贤无像亦无堂，败柳犹垂赤土墙。\n官卖神祠有前例，熙宁丞相起坊场。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1053,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"三贤堂移入西湖新书院","author":"方回","text":"湖边莫怪旧祠荒，士女何曾炷瓣香。\n赖是人心犹未泯，深衣迎奉入书堂。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1054,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"上元再题","author":"方回","text":"梅残万点路傍雪，桃露一班梢上红。\n惆怅六鳌山已去，了无情绪答春风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1055,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"下营晓行二首 其二","author":"方回","text":"月淡云浓弄晓晴，草中白处路微明。\n垂鞭缓辔十馀里，始听鸣鸡第一声。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1056,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"下营晓行二首 其一","author":"方回","text":"霜锲驼裘耳欲冰，谁家先我已宵兴。\n道傍篱落遮丛筱，隔火荧荧见一灯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1057,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其十","author":"方回","text":"江南菊花差晚开，把酒前兰复后梅。\n天公何尝负此老，天下腐儒臣方回。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1058,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其九","author":"方回","text":"有酒泛菊釂美酒，无酒嗅菊倚阑干。\n时人谁会先生意，常把霜枝子细看。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1059,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其八","author":"方回","text":"把之手香嚼齿香，饫之燕之香肺肠。\n金英满泛日百盏，何必帝乡姑醉乡。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1060,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其七","author":"方回","text":"风霜无畏最耐久，粪壤不资真自然。\n正则夕餐骨已换，凌江端作跨鳌仙。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1061,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其六","author":"方回","text":"菊芳兰秀幸同时，汾水刘郎语最悲。\n谁果肖兰谁肖菊，未知黄落又为谁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1062,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其五","author":"方回","text":"平生我解量人品，元亮真成晋伯夷。\n我欲招魂无别物，剩将酒洒菊花枝。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1063,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其四","author":"方回","text":"紫阳山下园五亩，一半教儿种菊花。\n霜渐浓时花更好，六年何事未还家。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1064,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其三","author":"方回","text":"倏过重阳几一月，菊花更觉有精神。\n必重阳日始赏菊，此是人间最俗人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1065,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其二","author":"方回","text":"种就株株攒万蕊，摘多干干茁三桠。\n此诗两句烦君听，不是閒花是菊花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1066,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"久过重阳菊英粲然即事十首 其一","author":"方回","text":"早伴茱萸插帽纱，尚堪荐酒更堪茶。\n花边行立花边坐，不是閒花是菊花。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1067,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其四十","author":"方回","text":"凶人凶其吉，吉人吉其凶。\n曳轮能自信，揲策勿求通。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1068,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十九","author":"方回","text":"全卦定凶吉，逐爻殊否臧。\n顷刻有变易，纵横无典常。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1069,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十八","author":"方回","text":"易乃一量秤，铢铢分重轻。\n百千亿万事，义理是权衡。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1070,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十七","author":"方回","text":"屡厄未济旅，难逢既济丰。\n巽谦能自降，蹇困讵为穷。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1071,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十六","author":"方回","text":"震动对艮止，革故继鼎新。\n饮啐随时义，天机信屈伸。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1072,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十五","author":"方回","text":"原筮而后比，无疑方可升。\n不食匪井患，有言奚困亨。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1073,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十四","author":"方回","text":"六籍火未熄，龙兴芒砀云。\n呼韩朝渭上，已纳王政君。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1074,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十三","author":"方回","text":"五王复唐祚，不杀武三思。\n苋陆察爻义，惜哉张柬之。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1075,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十二","author":"方回","text":"损其不善者，惟善则益之。\n自然获天祐，可受十朋龟。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1076,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十一","author":"方回","text":"在险惟反己，出险即及人。\n让夷急病者，蹇解二忠臣。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1077,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其三十","author":"方回","text":"一女卦反对，不同而后同。\n始知天下事，苟合最为凶。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1078,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其二十九","author":"方回","text":"夜闇勿遽戚，昼光无疾行。\n自昭惟进德，用晦岂伤明。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1079,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其二十八","author":"方回","text":"姤阴进不已，吾遁其奚言。\n阳壮过于泰，□虞羝触藩。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1080,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其二十七","author":"方回","text":"咸取男下女，恒言妇事夫。\n始感终当□，君臣其谨诸。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1081,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其二十六","author":"方回","text":"习坎德天险，重离文日新。\n明内始照外，亨心方发身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1082,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"大衍易吟四十首 其二十五","author":"方回","text":"大过本末弱，厄运逢瞒奴。\n文举有死耳，渊明其归乎。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":1083,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]